🚀 Top 15 Java Streams, Lambda & Functional Programming Questions
With Code + Output (Interview Revision)
1. Filter Even Numbers
Question

Filter all even numbers from a list.

Code
List<Integer> nums = Arrays.asList(1,2,3,4,5,6);

List<Integer> result =
        nums.stream()
            .filter(n -> n % 2 == 0)
            .toList();

System.out.println(result);

Output
[2, 4, 6]

2. Convert Names to Uppercase using map()
Code
