13. Find Duplicate Elements
Code
List<Integer> nums =
Arrays.asList(1,2,2,3,4,4,5);

Set<Integer> set =
new HashSet<>();

List<Integer> duplicates =

nums.stream()

.filter(n -> !set.add(n))

.toList();

System.out.println(duplicates);

Output
[2, 4]


✅ Banking Interview Favorite

14. Find Second Highest Number
Code
int value =

Arrays.asList(10,5,20,40,30)

.stream()

.sorted(Comparator.reverseOrder())

.skip(1)

.findFirst()

.get();

System.out.println(value);

Output
30

15. Find Highest Salary Employee
Code
