ROW-WISE SUM OF TWO LISTS

(Asked by you recently)

Code
List<Integer> list1 =
Arrays.asList(1,2,5);

List<Integer> list2 =
Arrays.asList(6,4,3);

List<Integer> result =

IntStream.range(0, list1.size())

.mapToObj(i ->
      list1.get(i)
    + list2.get(i))

.toList();

System.out.println(result);

Output
[7, 6, 8]

